Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================================
;  Removes the "Combine PDF" folder context menu installed by
;  combine-pdf-context-menu.reg.
;
;  The leading "-" on a key name means DELETE THAT KEY AND EVERYTHING UNDER IT,
;  so this one line clears the parent entry and all four submenu items. Nothing
;  outside this key is touched, and no files are affected.
; ============================================================================

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\shell\CombinePDF]
